# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Guardian Co-Pilot — what stays out of the repository
#
# This repo ships CODE. It does not redistribute anyone else's data, footage or
# model weights: not the private trip dataset this project was first built
# against, not the public datasets the open-data evaluation streams, and not the
# pretrained checkpoints those pipelines download on first use.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Other people's data -----------------------------------------------------
# The trip dataset (cabin + road footage) is not ours to publish. Point
# GUARDIAN_DATA_ROOT at your own copy instead.
guardian_data/
data/raw/

# The competition organiser's Team Kit is their code, not ours to republish.
# The modules that read the private trip dataset import from it; see the
# README for which parts of this repo run standalone and which do not.
starterkit/

# Everything derived from that footage: cached perception, extracted features,
# rendered demo video, and the prediction CSVs built from it.
artifacts/
predictions/
predictions_selfcheck/

# Rendered demo video is derived from that same private footage.
*.mp4
*.avi

# --- Model weights (downloaded on first use, not vendored) -------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.task
*.tflite
*.joblib

# --- Local caches ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Hugging Face / torch caches if anyone points them at the tree
.cache/
hf_cache/

# --- Environments ------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/

# --- Editor / OS -------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Scratch from exploration sessions ---------------------------------------
probe_*
kscan.py
demo_explain.py
trace_*.txt
vocab_dump.txt
patch_*.py
scan.py
check_staged.py
fix2.py
commitmsg.txt
*.log
tmp/
